-# "dry-run" (the default) publishes nothing: the three files and the
-# filled-in texts come out as an artifact, and the run's summary shows both
-# texts, so a release can be checked before it goes out.
-#
-# "discord-repost" builds and publishes nothing: it posts an earlier
